    STIG-ID         : WN11-AU-000500

.TESTED ON
    Date(s) Tested  : 2026-11-18
    Tested By       : Suad Dreskovic
    Systems Tested  : Suad-VM-Test (Windows 11 Pro 25H2, Azure, Cyber Range 1)
    PowerShell Ver. : 5.1

.USAGE
    Run in an elevated (Administrator) PowerShell on the VM:
    PS C:\> .\WN11-AU-000500.ps1
    Then rescan with Tenable ("Suad-VM-Test DISA STIG scan (Win 11)") and confirm WN11-AU-000500 shows Passed.

.CORRECTION
    Configure the policy value for Computer Configuration >> Administrative Templates >> Windows Components >> Event Log Service >> 
    Application >> "Specify the maximum log file size (KB)" to "Enabled" with a "Maximum Log Size (KB)" of "32768" or greater.
    Then rescan with Tenable ("Suad-VM-Test" DISA STIG scan (Win 11)") and confirm WN11-AU-000500 shows Passed.

